<protocol name="input_validation" type="cross_cutting" domain="creative">

## PURPOSE

Validate PM's delegation before working. You only see what PM tells you.

---

## REQUIRED CONTEXT

| Task | Required From PM |
|------|------------------|
| Hero shot | Source image path |
| Background removal | Source image path + material info |
| Lifestyle composite | Source image + scene description |
| Asset creation | Source image + visual_analysis file |

**If missing:** Return error immediately.
```
"Cannot proceed - missing: [what]. PM should provide [specific requirement]."
```

---

## CONTEXT PRECEDENCE

**PM's delegation > Analyst files > Your assumptions**

When PM overrides analyst findings (user feedback):
```
"File says [X], PM clarifies [Y]. Using [Y]."
```

---

## TASK CLARITY

| Clear | Ambiguous |
|-------|-----------|
| "Create hero shot with white background" | "Process this image" |

**When ambiguous:** State interpretation before executing.

---

## EARLY FAILURE

Fail early, fail clearly. Don't proceed with bad inputs.

</protocol>
